Subject: [PATCH 6/6] fix(passkey): request the app's own client ID and offer
 the passkey only where it is the page's host

saveSession rejects grants for any other client ID, and Ring rejects a cid that is not the rpId,
so a deploy must set PUBKY_RUNTIME_AUTH_CLIENT_ID to its host for the passkey path to appear.
